   "position": [
    0,
    0
   ],
   "webhookId": "72d55c2a-b6dc-4dc5-9e5c-8862d673cd5e",
   "notes": "POST http://localhost:5678/webhook/kmds-s11  body(optional): {\"skip_ids\": false, \"source\": null}"
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "method": "POST",
    "url": "http://host.docker.internal:8090/runs",
    "sendBody": true,
    "specifyBody": "json",
    "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ skip_ids: $json.body?.skip_ids ?? false, source: $json.body?.source ?? null, n8n_execution_id: $execution.id, n8n_workflow_id: $workflow.id }) }}",
    "options": {
     "timeout": 180000
    }
   },
   "id": "t0t2",
   "name": "T0 baseline · T2 IDS 전달 (run 생성)",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
   "typeVersion": 4.2,
   "position": [
    272,
    0
   ],
   "notes": "하네스: run_NN 생성, T0 baseline(코드/데이터 해시), T2 K-MDS IDS Consumer 아티팩트 수신·원본 해시 비교(자격증명 없으면 NOT_TESTED)"
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "jsCode": "const r = $input.first().json;\nreturn r.events.map((e, i) => ({ json: { run_id: r.run_id, seq: i, cid: e.correlation_id, event_key: e.eventKey, agent_ingress: 'http://host.docker.internal:8001/api/v1/ids/events', record: e } }));"
   },
   "id": "split",
   "name": "이벤트 분리 (시각순)",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
   "typeVersion": 2,
   "position": [
    528,
    0
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "method": "POST",
    "url": "={{ $json.agent_ingress }}",
    "sendBody": true,
    "specifyBody": "json",
    "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.record) }}",
    "options": {
     "batching": {
      "batch": {
       "batchSize": 1,
       "batchInterval": 0
      }
     },
     "response": {
      "response": {
       "fullResponse": true,
       "neverError": true
      }
     },
     "timeout": 300000
    }
   },
   "id": "agent",
   "name": "T3~T5 GHG AI Agent 매핑·검증 (이벤트별)",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
   "typeVersion": 4.2,
   "position": [
    784,
    0
   ],
   "notes": "에이전트 HTTP ingress(/api/v1/ids/events): profile→map(IMO Compendium, Gemini 후보 제안→skill 검증)→validate→transform. 이벤트 1건씩 순차. 200/422/409 모두 수집."
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "jsCode": "const src = $('이벤트 분리 (시각순)').all();\nconst res = $input.all();\nconst results = res.map((it, i) => {\n  const b = it.json.body || {};\n  return { cid: src[i].json.cid, event_key: src[i].json.event_key, http_status: it.json.statusCode, final_status: b.final_status ?? null, error: b.error ?? (b.detail ? JSON.stringify(b.detail) : null) };\n});\nreturn [{ json: { run_id: src[0].json.run_id, results, ok: results.filter(r => r.http_status === 200).length, total: results.length } }];"
   },
   "id": "agg",
   "name": "이벤트 결과 취합",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
   "typeVersion": 2,
   "position": [
    1040,
    0
   ]
  },
  {
   "parameters": {
    "method": "POST",
    "url": "=http://host.docker.internal:8090/runs/{{ $json.run_id }}/collect",
    "sendBody": true,
    "specifyBody": "json",
    "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ results: $json.results }) }}",
    "options": {
     "timeout": 120000
    }
   },
   "id": "collect",
   "name": "T5 증적 수집·무결성",
